{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】一名6歲女童感染甲型流感併發休克，情況危殆。</p><p>衞生防護中心稱，女童上周四發燒、流鼻水和嘔吐，在屯門醫院治療，兩日後情況轉壞，移送兒童深切治療部，情況危殆。中心指她潛伏期內無外遊，今年度未接種流感疫苗。6月至今累計24宗兒童感染流感嚴重個案。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T12:59:05.644696+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T12:12:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T18:17:58.862256+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T12:57:35.563478+00:00","content_hash":"0742366185b395c9d0cd3b2d185257579c0b2939f100ab1899ff30efab5b8677","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}